"Overloaded error": ["HTTP 529 with error type overloaded_error: the API is temporarily overloaded. Retryable with exponential backoff. The SDKs retry it automatically.", "`except anthropic.OverloadedError:", ["Rate limits", "Exponential backoff", "retry-after"], ["Claude docs: Errors", "https://platform.claude.com/docs/en/api/errors"]],
"Exponential backoff": ["A retry strategy where each wait grows, often with random jitter so clients don’t retry together. The SDKs retry 408, 409, 429 and 5xx up to twice, honoring retry-after.", "`anthropic.Anthropic(max_retries=5)", ["Overloaded error", "retry-after", "Rate limits"], ["Claude docs: Errors", "https://platform.claude.com/docs/en/api/errors"]],
