"Augmented LLM": ["A model call extended with retrieval (looking things up), tools and memory. The model writes its own search queries, picks tools and decides what to keep.", "Diagrams in Anthropic’s “Building effective agents”.", ["Prompt chaining", "Agent", "Tool use"], ["Anthropic: Building effective agents", "https://www.anthropic.com/engineering/building-effective-agents"]],
"Prompt chaining": ["A workflow that splits a task into fixed steps. Each model call processes the previous call’s output, and code can check results between steps. It trades speed for accuracy.", "`outline = call(a); draft = call(b, outline)", ["Routing", "Workflow", "Evaluator-optimizer"], ["Anthropic: Building effective agents", "https://www.anthropic.com/engineering/building-effective-agents"]],
"Routing": ["A workflow that classifies (sorts) each input, then sends it to a follow-up prompt, tool or model built for that category.", "Help desks that send billing, tech and sales questions down separate paths.", ["Prompt chaining", "Model family", "Workflow"], ["Anthropic: Building effective agents", "https://www.anthropic.com/engineering/building-effective-agents"]],
